OL,3,ATwelve dead after motorway pile-ups in
OL,4,ABulgaria fog
OL,5,
OL,6,FSliven regional governor Mihail
OL,7,FKasherov told journalists that more
OL,8,Fthan 70 vehicles were involved in the
OL,9,Fincident, Bulgarian state news agency
OL,10,FBTA reported.
OL,12,FOfficials have said dense fog reduced
OL,13,Fvisibility and was the likely cause of
OL,14,Fthe first crash, which occurred on the
OL,15,Feastbound carriageway.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
